          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="msg_2005" value="5. Persistence confirmed (HTTP 200 / Store OK)" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#1e3a8a;strokeWidth=1.8;strokeDashed=1;endArrow=open;endFill=1;fontSize=12;fontColor=#0f172a;" edge="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint x="1455" y="425" as="sourcePoint" />
            <mxPoint x="1195" y="425" as="targetPoint" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="msg_2006" value="6. MQTT PUBACK / HTTP 2xx response" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#1e3a8a;strokeWidth=1.8;strokeDashed=1;endArrow=open;endFill=1;fontSize=12;fontColor=#0f172a;" edge="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint x="1195" y="450" as="sourcePoint" />
            <mxPoint x="935" y="450" as="targetPoint" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="msg_2007" value="7. Acknowledgment delivered to device" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#1e3a8a;strokeWidth=1.8;strokeDashed=1;endArrow=open;endFill=1;fontSize=12;fontColor=#0f172a;" edge="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint x="935" y="475" as="sourcePoint" />
            <mxPoint x="415" y="475" as="targetPoint" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p1_phase2" value="2. SIGNAL LOSS &amp; OFFLINE BUFFERING — Store-and-Forward (Max 24 h Retention)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fee2e2;strokeColor=#ef4444;fontColor=#b91c1c;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;align=left;spacingLeft=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="60" y="510" width="1740" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="box_signal_drop" value="LINK LOST: Cellular RAN unavailable / Satellite contact pass ended / Center WAN service severed&#10;link_state = offline. Devices &amp; apps switch to offline store-and-forward mode." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fef2f2;strokeColor=#f87171;fontColor=#991b1b;fontSize=11;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="800" y="550" width="480" height="50" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="msg_2008" value="8. Reading / GNSS fix taken offline (original recorded_at timestamp)" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#1e3a8a;strokeWidth=1.8;strokeDashed=0;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=12;fontColor=#0f172a;" edge="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint x="160" y="620" as="sourcePoint" />
            <mxPoint x="415" y="620" as="targetPoint" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="msg_2009" value="9. Write to local encrypted buffer (node_id, sequence_no, recorded_at, values)" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#1e3a8a;strokeWidth=1.8;strokeDashed=0;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=12;fontColor=#0f172a;" edge="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint x="415" y="650" as="sourcePoint" />
            <mxPoint x="675" y="650" as="targetPoint" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="msg_2010" value="10. Stored in non-volatile flash (survives reboot/battery depletion)" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#1e3a8a;strokeWidth=1.8;strokeDashed=1;endArrow=open;endFill=1;fontSize=12;fontColor=#0f172a;" edge="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint x="675" y="680" as="sourcePoint" />
            <mxPoint x="415" y="680" as="targetPoint" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="box_buf_rules" value="BUFFER RETENTION CONSTRAINTS (ASM-074, ASM-076, ASM-079):&#10;- Field Telemetry: Non-volatile ring buffer. Sized with margin (&gt;=30 readings). Max retention 24 hours.&#10;  Readings older than 24 h without ACK are evicted; local drop_counter is incremented.&#10;- Transporter Phone Outbox: 7 days capacity (2,016 fixes). Custody events are NEVER evicted.&#10;- Logistics Post: Encrypted outbox. Reception events held until persistence ACK. Zero data loss." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fffbeb;strokeColor=#d97706;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#92400e;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="100" y="715" width="800" height="85" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="msg_2011" value="11. Multiple readings accumulate during outage (sequence numbers increment)" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#1e3a8a;strokeWidth=1.8;strokeDashed=0;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=12;fontColor=#0f172a;" edge="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint x="160" y="820" as="sourcePoint" />
            <mxPoint x="415" y="820" as="targetPoint" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="msg_2012" value="12. Append to buffer; buffer ring tracks oldest and newest sequence numbers" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#1e3a8a;strokeWidth=1.8;strokeDashed=0;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=12;fontColor=#0f172a;" edge="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint x="415" y="850" as="sourcePoint" />
            <mxPoint x="675" y="850" as="targetPoint" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p1_phase3" value="3. RECONNECTION &amp; ORDERED REPLAY — Live Reading First, Then Oldest First (ASM-074)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fef3c7;strokeColor=#f59e0b;fontColor=#b45309;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;align=left;spacingLeft=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="60" y="895" width="1740" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="box_reconnect" value="LINK RESTORED: Radio attaches to network; TLS 1.2+ mutual authentication re-established." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ecfdf5;strokeColor=#10b981;fontColor=#065f46;fontSize=11;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="800" y="935" width="480" height="40" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="msg_2013" value="13. Reconnection Event: Fresh live reading taken at reconnect" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#16a34a;strokeWidth=1.8;strokeDashed=0;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=12;fontColor=#0f172a;" edge="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint x="160" y="990" as="sourcePoint" />
            <mxPoint x="415" y="990" as="targetPoint" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="msg_2014" value="14. [LIVE FIRST] Publish live reading immediately (Never waits behind history!)" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#16a34a;strokeWidth=1.8;strokeDashed=0;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=12;fontColor=#0f172a;" edge="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint x="415" y="1020" as="sourcePoint" />
            <mxPoint x="935" y="1020" as="targetPoint" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="msg_2015" value="15. Live reading arrives at IoT Core (QoS 1)" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#16a34a;strokeWidth=1.8;strokeDashed=0;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=12;fontColor=#0f172a;" edge="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint x="935" y="1050" as="sourcePoint" />
            <mxPoint x="1195" y="1050" as="targetPoint" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="msg_2016" value="16. Persist live reading in DynamoDB" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#16a34a;strokeWidth=1.8;strokeDashed=0;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=12;fontColor=#0f172a;" edge="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint x="1195" y="1080" as="sourcePoint" />
            <mxPoint x="1455" y="1080" as="targetPoint" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="msg_2017" value="17. Evaluate live reading (raises live alert if out-of-range)" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#16a34a;strokeWidth=1.8;strokeDashed=0;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=12;fontColor=#0f172a;" edge="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint x="1195" y="1110" as="sourcePoint" />
            <mxPoint x="1695" y="1110" as="targetPoint" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="msg_2018" value="18. MQTT PUBACK for live reading delivered to device" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#16a34a;strokeWidth=1.8;strokeDashed=1;endArrow=open;endFill=1;fontSize=12;fontColor=#0f172a;" edge="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint x="1195" y="1140" as="sourcePoint" />
            <mxPoint x="415" y="1140" as="targetPoint" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="box_drain_rule" value="DRAIN ORDER: Now buffer drains OLDEST FIRST in batches.&#10;First drain message carries drop_counter, oldest sequence_no, and newest sequence_no (gap report)." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ecfdf5;strokeColor=#059669;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#065f46;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="100" y="1170" width="750" height="45" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="msg_2019" value="19. Fetch oldest buffered reading (chronological sequence)" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#1e3a8a;strokeWidth=1.8;strokeDashed=0;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=12;fontColor=#0f172a;" edge="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint x="415" y="1230" as="sourcePoint" />
            <mxPoint x="675" y="1230" as="targetPoint" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="msg_2020" value="20. Return buffered record with original recorded_at timestamp" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#1e3a8a;strokeWidth=1.8;strokeDashed=1;endArrow=open;endFill=1;fontSize=12;fontColor=#0f172a;" edge="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint x="675" y="1260" as="sourcePoint" />
            <mxPoint x="415" y="1260" as="targetPoint" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="msg_2021" value="21. [DRAIN OLDEST] Publish buffered message (includes drop_counter &amp; original time)" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#1e3a8a;strokeWidth=1.8;strokeDashed=0;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=12;fontColor=#0f172a;" edge="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint x="415" y="1290" as="sourcePoint" />
            <mxPoint x="935" y="1290" as="targetPoint" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="msg_2022" value="22. Ingest drained message at regional endpoint" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#1e3a8a;strokeWidth=1.8;strokeDashed=0;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=12;fontColor=#0f172a;" edge="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint x="935" y="1320" as="sourcePoint" />
            <mxPoint x="1195" y="1320" as="targetPoint" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p1_phase4" value="4. IDEMPOTENT DEDUPLICATION &amp; RELEASE ON ACKNOWLEDGMENT (ADR-003, ASM-011)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dbeafe;strokeColor=#3b82f6;fontColor=#1e40af;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;align=left;spacingLeft=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="60" y="1360" width="1740" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="msg_2023" value="23. Primary key lookup &amp; upsert (node_id + reading_timestamp / event_id)" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#1e3a8a;strokeWidth=1.8;strokeDashed=0;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=12;fontColor=#0f172a;" edge="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint x="1195" y="1410" as="sourcePoint" />
            <mxPoint x="1455" y="1410" as="targetPoint" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="box_dedup" value="IDEMPOTENT DEDUPLICATION:&#10;If duplicate delivery occurs (e.g. lost PUBACK/ACK),&#10;cloud upserts harmlessly. Zero duplicate alerts or ghost records." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#eff6ff;strokeColor=#3b82f6;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#1e40af;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1300" y="1435" width="420" height="60" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="msg_2024" value="24. Store confirmed; duplicate absorbed harmlessly" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#1e3a8a;strokeWidth=1.8;strokeDashed=1;endArrow=open;endFill=1;fontSize=12;fontColor=#0f172a;" edge="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint x="1455" y="1510" as="sourcePoint" />
            <mxPoint x="1195" y="1510" as="targetPoint" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="msg_2025" value="25. Evaluate drained reading vs alert thresholds (evaluated as if live)" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#1e3a8a;strokeWidth=1.8;strokeDashed=0;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=12;fontColor=#0f172a;" edge="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint x="1195" y="1540" as="sourcePoint" />
            <mxPoint x="1695" y="1540" as="targetPoint" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="box_eval_drain" value="DRAINED READING EVALUATION:&#10;Alert emitted at drain time, within 24 hours. Delay is measured from&#10;original timestamp, clearly distinguishing drained alerts from live ones." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fffbeb;strokeColor=#d97706;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#92400e;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1430" y="1565" width="340" height="65" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="msg_2026" value="26. MQTT PUBACK / HTTP 200 confirmed" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#1e3a8a;strokeWidth=1.8;strokeDashed=1;endArrow=open;endFill=1;fontSize=12;fontColor=#0f172a;" edge="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint x="1195" y="1645" as="sourcePoint" />
            <mxPoint x="935" y="1645" as="targetPoint" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="msg_2027" value="27. Verified ACK delivered to node controller" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#1e3a8a;strokeWidth=1.8;strokeDashed=1;endArrow=open;endFill=1;fontSize=12;fontColor=#0f172a;" edge="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint x="935" y="1675" as="sourcePoint" />
            <mxPoint x="415" y="1675" as="targetPoint" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="msg_2028" value="28. RELEASE ON ACK: Delete acknowledged record from buffer" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#16a34a;strokeWidth=1.8;strokeDashed=0;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=12;fontColor=#0f172a;" edge="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint x="415" y="1705" as="sourcePoint" />
            <mxPoint x="675" y="1705" as="targetPoint" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="box_release_ack" value="RELEASE CONTRACT: A record leaves the local buffer ONLY when verified cloud ACK is received.&#10;If session drops mid-drain, remaining records stay and drain resumes at next reconnect." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ecfdf5;strokeColor=#059669;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#065f46;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="100" y="1735" width="750" height="45" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p1_summary_box" value="PART 1 CONTRACT SUMMARY — OFFLINE BEHAVIOR &amp; PROTOCOL PROPERTIES:&#10;1. Store-and-Forward: Max 24 h retention for farm &amp; wet mill telemetry (ASM-074). Unacknowledged records &gt;24 h evicted with gap report.&#10;2. Transporter Outbox: 7 days capacity (2,016 fixes at 5 min interval). Custody events are never evicted; oldest fixes thinned to 15 min if full.&#10;3. Drone Buffer: Storage on drone &amp; ground station has NO time limit. Fumigation cannot close until flight record is persisted in cloud.&#10;4. Replay Ordering: LIVE reading taken at reconnect published FIRST (never waits behind history); then buffered history drains OLDEST FIRST.&#10;5. Release on ACK: Record released ONLY after MQTT PUBACK, HTTP 2xx, or verified S3 multipart checksum. Lost ACK causes safe duplicate.&#10;6. Idempotency: Cloud stores keyed by (node_id + reading_timestamp) or UUID event_id. Duplicate delivery is harmlessly deduped." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8fafc;strokeColor=#475569;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0f172a;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="60" y="1800" width="1740" height="170" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p1_obs_box" value="OBSERVABILITY OF SILENT NODES (Case Point 6 &amp; A21):&#10;Nodes and farms silent for more than 24 hours are detected by CloudWatch metric alarms and reported in daily operational dashboard.&#10;Drained alerts are measured against the 24-hour limit, keeping the live &lt;5 minute SLO unpolluted by buffer drains." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fffbeb;strokeColor=#d97706;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#92400e;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="60" y="1990" width="1740" height="75" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="grp_part2" value="PART 2: CROP ALERT IN UNDER 5 MINUTES — PER-HOP LATENCY BUDGET (ROUTE AVAILABLE)&#10;(docs/connectivity.md Section 8 &amp; Case Statement Point 3: 'menos de 5 minutos desde la lectura fuera de rango')" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8fafc;strokeColor=#475569;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#0f172a;fontSize=17;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=14;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1860" y="125" width="1800" height="2140" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
